WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.958
From Live cost, choose Save Quality & Create Costing. Review the yarn rates, overhead, margin and quantity, then save the quality and its first costing snapshot together.

2
00:00:14.958 --> 00:00:39.958
Search the saved-quality library for Demo. Open the rate editor, change the warp rate from Rs 125 to Rs 130/kg, review its cost impact, and save and apply the quality. Existing costing snapshots stay unchanged.

3
00:00:39.958 --> 00:00:51.958
Open the quality library and select the saved fabric to restore its yarn recipe and costing assumptions without entering all the inputs again.
